F4: one non-deterministic heading-order "incomplete" flicker on the glide-
revealed state, alternating between trees across repeated captures of the
SAME tree — harness/async-chart timing artifact, not attributable to
either tree's code.

Manual walks of every WS-introduced surface (D6, D7 both branches, WS4.2's
